    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "To perform a bracketed capture of multiple images with varied capture settings, create a [`AVCapturePhotoBracketSettings`](avcapturephotobracketsettings.md) instance containing the combination of settings and bracketed variations you want.",
      "ko": "The property returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) if video stabilization is currently in use; otherwise [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "sourceHash": "88c641e7c66033f9c30f229a8f4888bd4a658e6d8f96c314477091ac62c1db64",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The maximum number of photos per capture depends on the size and format of images to be captured.",
      "ko": "캡처당 최대 사진 수는 캡처할 이미지의 크기와 형식에 따라 달라집니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6c4bc15dc6153c63520b881e44a03ee9a4f6d72b835d27b05996d4c6b8983a91",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: This property’s value can change if the [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) property of the current capture session or the [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) property of the underlying capture device changes.",
      "ko": "**Note**: 현재 캡처 세션의 [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) 속성이나 기본 캡처 장치의 [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) 속성이 변경되면 이 속성의 값이 변경될 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6ebdced778d35dd8229de173268741aca8cddbf72fb7a9dcb1b7244239cc9d7a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Not all devices and capture formats support bracketed capture.",
      "ko": "모든 기기와 캡처 형식이 브래킷 캡처를 지원하지는 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b9d46ed419858f3f349e3e38e2d8525e1c5c4facf7d27f27ac815732a1a9e081",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "If the current device or active format does not support bracketed capture, this property’s value is zero.",
      "ko": "현재 장치 또는 활성 형식이 브래킷 캡처를 지원하지 않으면 이 속성의 값은 0입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a0268fd4d74f073f7a177e762d2bf0a99eb6eac46d32ad9a25942d16f5403e9c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This property supports key-value observing.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관찰(key-value observing)을 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d191ec2919976839580c125b2fe0468e3c46d7fe0f54949bb4493094ada7e47e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
